        :rulingDate "2016-09-20"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """You don't have to target a creature with Aetherstorm Roc's last ability. If you do choose a target, and that target becomes illegal, the ability doesn't resolve and you won't be able to pay {E}{E} to put a counter on Aetherstorm Roc."""@en ] ,
